---
import '@fontsource/fraunces/latin-600.css';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import { BRAND, href, INDEXABLE, NICHE } from '../lib/content';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  noindex?: boolean;
  ogType?: 'website' | 'article';
  ogImage?: string;
  jsonLd?: object[];
}
const { title, description, noindex = false, ogType = 'website', ogImage = '/og/default.jpg', jsonLd = [] } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site);
const robots = INDEXABLE && !noindex ? 'index,follow' : 'noindex,nofollow';
const image = new URL(ogImage, Astro.site).href;
const path = Astro.url.pathname;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content={robots} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical.href} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1E5B4C" />
    <meta name="bem-build" content={process.env.GITHUB_SHA ?? 'local'} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content={BRAND} />
    <meta property="og:type" content={ogType} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical.href} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={image} />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="pt_BR" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <link rel="icon" href={href('/favicon.svg')} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href={href('/apple-touch-icon.png')} />
    {jsonLd.map((d) => <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(d)} />)}
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #fbfaf7;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --sand: #f4efe6;
        --ink: #15241f;
        --muted: #55635c;
        --line: #e7e2d8;
        --brand: #1e5b4c;
        --brand-ink: #123d33;
        --brand-soft: #e6f2ec;
        --amber: #f0b252;
        --amber-soft: #fdf3e1;
        --warn: #8a5a12;
        --radius: 16px;
        --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(21, 36, 31, 0.05), 0 10px 30px -18px rgba(21, 36, 31, 0.25);
        --display: 'Fraunces', 'Iowan Old Style', Georgia, serif;
        --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
        --measure: 44rem;
        --wide: 74rem;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; scroll-padding-top: 5rem; }
      body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font: 1.0625rem/1.72 var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
      a { color: var(--brand); text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
      a:hover { color: var(--brand-ink); }
      :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
      img, svg { max-width: 100%; }
      .wrap { max-width: var(--wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
      .narrow { max-width: var(--measure); }

      h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.2vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
      h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.2; margin: 3rem 0 0.9rem; }
      h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.3; }
      p { margin: 0 0 1.05rem; }

      .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0.28rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand-ink); font: 600 0.74rem/1.2 var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--brand); color: #fff; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s; }
      .btn:hover { background: var(--brand-ink); color: #fff; transform: translateY(-1px); }

      .site-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: rgba(251, 250, 247, 0.88); backdrop-filter: saturate(1.4) blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(1.4) blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .site-header .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; height: 4rem; }
      .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font: 600 1.22rem/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      .brand:hover { color: var(--ink); }
      .site-nav { display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; }
      .site-nav a { padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.93rem; font-weight: 550; text-decoration: none; }
      .site-nav a:hover, .site-nav a[aria-current='page'] { background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand-ink); }
      @media (max-width: 30rem) { .brand span { display: none; } .site-nav a { padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem; } }

      .site-footer { margin-top: 5rem; background: var(--brand-ink); color: #cfe0d8; font-size: 0.92rem; }
      .site-footer .wrap { display: grid; gap: 2rem; padding-block: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      @media (min-width: 52rem) { .site-footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr; } }
      .site-footer h2 { margin: 0 0 0.7rem; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0; }
      .site-footer a { color: #fff; }
      .site-footer p { margin: 0 0 0.7rem; }
      .foot-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; color: #fff; font: 600 1.2rem/1 var(--display); text-decoration: none; }
      .foot-links { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .foot-links li { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
      .foot-legal p { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
      #nota-imagens:target { color: #fff; }
      .foot-legal { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding-top: 1.4rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); font-size: 0.82rem; color: #a9c2b8; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <a class="brand" href={href('/')} aria-label={`${BRAND}, página inicial`}><Logo size={34} /><span>{BRAND}</span></a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Principal">
          <a href={href('/#guias')} aria-current={path === href('/') ? 'page' : undefined}>Guias</a>
          <a href={href('/como-trabalhamos/')} aria-current={path.startsWith(href('/como-trabalhamos')) ? 'page' : undefined}>Como trabalhamos</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main><slot /></main>
    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div>
          <a class="foot-brand" href={href('/')}><Logo size={30} invert /> {BRAND}</a>
          <p>{NICHE.site_tagline}</p>
          <p>Comparamos o que fabricantes, normas técnicas e órgãos reguladores publicam. Não testamos produtos fisicamente; dado sem fonte não entra.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Navegue</h2>
          <ul class="foot-links">
            <li><a href={href('/#guias')}>Todos os guias</a></li>
            <li><a href={href('/como-trabalhamos/')}>Como trabalhamos</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Transparência</h2>
          <p>Como participante do Programa de Associados da Amazon, somos remunerados pelas compras qualificadas feitas por meio dos nossos links. Isso não muda o que escrevemos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="foot-legal">
          <p>Nada aqui substitui orientação de profissional de saúde.</p>
          <p id="nota-imagens">* Imagens ilustrativas geradas por inteligência artificial, sem marca: mostram o tipo de produto, não um produto, marca ou modelo específico. A construção real varia por fabricante e modelo.</p>
          <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {BRAND}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
